id: pm-p8s5k7e6lhda
title: Resolve aliased workspace paths before publishing tracker cache exclusions
description: "GH #1544 and #1477: hosted cache-ignore-scopes failures plus independent published-artifact Linux symlink reproduction expose lexical-vs-physical root mismatch. Canonicalize equivalent existing paths without treating real external roots as internal. Preserve user bytes, sibling tracker scopes and literal names through both init orders/repeats."
