acceptance_criteria: Public SDK protects alias-addressed internal trackers and missing descendants; external symlinks remain no-ops; actual CLI/Git checks cover both init orders and literal names; hosted Windows and macOS regression legs pass
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: medium
confidence: high
expected_result: "Physical and aliased paths for an internal tracker publish identical literal cache exclusions across repeated init, while real external roots and unrelated user rules remain protected."
