comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-22T10:16:14.746Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: strict full all-status read of 3058 items completed with zero unreadable records and no omissions. Request-specific search and full live canonical history reads found completed adjacent work but no owner for this newly reported boundary. Reuse the existing capability lineage and retain prior closures."
  "2026-10-22T10:16:36.725Z","harness:codex","Live intake: baseline main ec2e9db8f has no open PRs and zero Dependabot, CodeQL and secret-scanning alerts. Strict all-status corpus receipt: 3058/3058 records, complete with zero unreadable entries and no omissions, zero in-progress items. Prior cache fixes and recurrence measurement have completed resolutions. The alias boundary is new. Batch preview refused existing non-regular tracker storage; ordinary atomic commit succeeded without changing storage or overriding policy."
  "2026-10-22T10:29:35.557Z","harness:codex","Failing-before proof in an isolated unchanged-main worktree: 9 alias/cache cases failed while 30 controls passed. After canonical physical containment, all 39 SDK and real CLI/Git cases pass, including both init orders, repeated initialization, literal names, curated eval-query exceptions, sibling merge attributes and external-symlink no-ops. Hosted Windows/macOS legs remain a separate required verification claim."
  "2026-10-22T11:05:56.675Z","harness:codex","Final focused run passes55 cases across public SDK containment, real CLI/Git scopes, verified replacement receipts and disabled health. Added refusal controls for inaccessible/missing physical ancestry, preserving the fail-closed boundary without lexical fallback. Retained backups now live under ignored runtime storage, verified by actual git check-ignore, and both hard persistence rollback failures and soft verification rollback failures carry executable recovery."
  "2026-10-22T12:36:39.068Z","harness:codex","PR1548 Sourcery generated guide marks GH1544 unaddressed because macOS remains two shards. That title-based inference does not match the live defect: current GH1544 logs and the unchanged published-artifact reproduction fail cache-ignore-scopes containment through physical path aliases; this SDK fix addresses that source boundary. Both macOS shards already passed in candidate Nightly39771151475. The separate latest workflow repartition addresses20-minute cancellations on Linux24/Windows1; do not conflate those causes or claim the old overall workflow green. No actionable inline Sourcery review exists; its actual review is quota unavailable."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-22T11:39:21.009Z","harness:codex","Compare physical ancestry for both workspace and tracker, retaining uncreated suffixes. Mixed lexical spellings can falsely look external; actual external symlink targets must remain outside the ignore-write boundary."
